        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86396, Crystal Brookmont Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Brookmont Crystal Cabinet Knob is made from clear crystal. Choose from small, medium, and large sizes. The Brookmont Clear Crystal Cabinet Knob is a great choice not only for kitchen cabinets, but also as a furniture pull for dressers. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Brookmont Cabinet Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Crystal with Brass Rosette</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86396-specifications.pdf?v=1704262413\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Brookmont Cabinet Knob Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>Small:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>Medium:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>Large:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Mount Finish Choices</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Brookmont Crystal Cabinet Knob",
                "description": "The Brookmont Crystal Cabinet Knob is a clear crystal knob available in clear, grey, blue, orange, and black. Choose from small, medium, and large sizes. The Brookmont Clear Crystal Cabinet Knob is a great choice not only for kitchen cabinets, but also as a furniture pull for dressers.",
